  "For a missing pet, open your pet’s profile and choose Report missing to send nearby alerts. For immediate danger to a person, contact local emergency services. For urgent pet injury or illness, contact a veterinarian.": "宠物走失时，请打开宠物资料并选择报告走失，向附近用户发送提醒。如有人身紧急危险，请联系当地急救服务。宠物受伤或突发疾病时，请联系兽医。",
  "OkTreat’s alerts and support tools do not replace emergency or veterinary care. Alert delivery and pet recovery are not guaranteed. Nearby alerts depend on users’ locations, notification settings and connectivity.": "OkTreat的提醒和客服工具不能替代急救或兽医服务，无法保证提醒送达或找回宠物。附近提醒取决于用户位置、通知设置和网络连接。",
  "OkTreat Support is not an emergency service. For urgent pet injury or illness, contact a veterinarian immediately. For immediate danger to a person, contact local emergency services. OkTreat Support is not monitored continuously.": "OkTreat客服不提供紧急救援服务。宠物受伤或突发疾病时，请立即联系兽医。如有人身紧急危险，请联系当地急救服务。客服并非全天候在线。",
  "Sitter identity checks": "宠物保姆身份验证",
